#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_templates.rst:135
msgid ""
"Variables in phpBB take the form of ``{{ X_YYYYY }}``, where the data is "
"assigned from the source. However, most language strings are not assigned "
"from the source. When a language variable is found, denoted as ``{{ "
"lang('YYYYYY') }}``, phpBB first checks if an assigned variable with that "
"name exists. If it does, it uses that. If not, it checks if an existing "
"string defined in the language file exists."
msgstr ""
"Variabler i phpBB har formen ``{{ X_YYYYY }}``, hvor dataene tildeles fra "
"kilden. De fleste sprogstrenge tildeles dog ikke fra kilden. Når en "
"sprogvariabel findes, angivet som ``{{ lang('YYYYYY') }}``, kontrollerer "
"phpBB først, om der findes en tildelt variabel med det navn. Hvis det er "
"tilfældet, bruges denne. Hvis ikke, kontrolleres det, om der findes en "
"eksisterende streng defineret i sprogfilen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_templates.rst:140
msgid ""
"By using the language variable format, phpBB allows for more flexibility in "
"the customization of language strings. This allows for easy modifications of"
" language strings in the language files without having to modify the source "
"code directly."
msgstr ""
"Ved at bruge sprogvariabelformatet giver phpBB mere fleksibilitet i "
"tilpasningen af sprogstrenge. Dette gør det muligt nemt at ændre "
"sprogstrenge i sprogfilerne uden at skulle ændre kildekoden direkte."

